    <string name="live_snapshot_explainer">Reads generic emissions codes, then requests each positively advertised reading in the implemented Mode 01 catalog once. Responders can return separate values; the sequential observations are not simultaneous. It uses the same bounded adapter setup; the connection stays open afterwards. Not yet tested on a vehicle. Hardware use needs separate owner authorization; never clear codes.</string>
    <string name="live_explainer">Reads the supported-reading map and stored and pending trouble codes from the car. It repeats the adapter setup (ATE0, ATL0, ATH1, ATSP0), then 0100, ATDPN, only the support pages the car advertises, 03 and 07. Discovery usually takes a few seconds and stops after 180 seconds at most. It never requests live sensor readings or clears codes. Car parked, ignition on, engine off.</string>
